      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TULLOCH ROAD (4) finds it hard to win. Finished third (18.03) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Top prospect. TINY MISTRESS (8) was below best at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh at this track, but was among the placings at The Gardens three back. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can improve sharply here. SCREAMING ENVY (1) was checked in the run and safely held when fifth (21.02) in a Grade 5 over 350m at Goulburn. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Has the ability and can atone with the right run. RITZY RITZY (7) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
